  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nDecoding signs:\n\n \n \n\n Letter\n J\n K\n L\n M\n \n \n\n Stands For\n ×\n -\n ÷\n +\n \n \n\n**Given:** 5 J 12 K 56 M 21 L 7 = ?\n\n5 J 12 K 56 M 21 L 7 = ? ⇒ 5 × 12 - 56 + 21 ÷ 7 = ?\n\n⇒ 5 × 12 - 56 + __**21 **____**÷**____** 7**__ = ?\n\n⇒ __5 ×____ **12**__ - 56 + 3 = ?\n\n⇒ __**60**____** + 3**__ - 56 = ?\n\n⇒ __**63**____** - 56**__ = ?\n\n⇒ 7 = ?\n\nHence, \"Option 4\" is the correct answer.",
